  "definition": {
    "en": "40 × 40 cm (square) — a trade poster size, as sold by print shops and framers; sized to common frames rather than to ISO 216.",
    "nb": "40 × 40 cm (kvadratisk) — bransjeformat for plakater, slik trykkerier og rammemakere selger det; tilpasset vanlige rammer, ikke ISO 216.",
    "de": "40 × 40 cm (quadratisch) — ein handelsübliches Plakatformat, auf gängige Rahmen abgestimmt, nicht auf ISO 216.",
    "es": "40 × 40 cm (square) — a trade poster size, as sold by print shops and framers; sized to common frames rather than to ISO 216.",
